      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yea became an issue not too long ago. There are a few scenarios which can result in 4pt tracking activating and breaking locomotion. Quite an annoyance that we cant disable full body from the in game menu.\nHeres the last known canny on this issue -  https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/4pt-stuck-in-place-after-calibration",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
