  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-04-12T06:56:49.147Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "To reproduce as it occurs for me, start VRChat with two trackers turned on and assigned to the left and right feet in SteamVR. While in the initial 4PT calibration state, turn on the hip tracker. Attempts to calibrate in this state will result in locked controls and a stuck avatar that does not follow your movement. This occurs even after turning off all Vive trackers.\nReporting on VRChat 2021.1.5p2, but I've encountered the bug beforehand for many versions.",
